Note: E21 and rt_c finding 8. Lists are owned like texts: a procedure's local list across calls, stores, pushes, item sets.
§1 To fill, do the following.
§1.1 Let ws be a list of 3 copies of 2.
§1.2 Append 5 to ws.
§1.3 Set item 1 of ws to 9.
§1.4 Say ws.
§2 Let xs be a list of 4 copies of 1.
§3 Let ys be xs.
§4 For each k from 1 to 3, do the following.
§4.1 Set ys to xs.
§4.2 Append k to xs.
§4.3 Perform fill.
§5 Remove the last item of xs.
§6 Say xs followed by " | " followed by ys.
